<section class="page-section" id="packages">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="pkg-intro-panel">
      <p class="pkg-intro-main"><strong>In short:</strong> Chayce Properties is a Northampton-based later-life moving service that arranges moves across the UK. Packages start from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }} for packing and removals, and rise to a fully bespoke relocation from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("platinum")).price | gbp }}. If you are not sure what you need, the simplest first step is the <a href="/discovery/">Discovery Consultation (&pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }})</a>: one hour, in person or by phone, ending in a plan, timeline and budget. Package prices are &ldquo;from&rdquo; prices; the final price depends on the scope agreed with you.</p>
      <ul class="pkg-facts">
        <li><strong>From &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}</strong><span>packing and removals</span></li>
        <li><strong>Fully insured</strong><span>every removal</span></li>
